								[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.PositiveEffect}:Increases defense] by [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.DoSomething}:1] when [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.DoSomething}:exposed to sunlight].
