							Super: {
								/* Short:
									'''
									Heals you for a huge amount when drank
									{$Mods.V2.ItemTooltip.Generic.HoldForInDepthFunctionAndLore}
									''' */
								/* Long:
									'''
									Heals you a huge amount all at once when drank.
									Since you're just swallowing the whole bottle, with the cap still on, you'll need the bottle to break first from running out of durability.
