								/* Long:
									'''
									[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.PositiveVoreEffect}:Increases ACI] by [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.DoSomething}:{ACI}].
									[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.PositiveVoreEffect}:Increases struggle strength] by [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.DoSomething}:{STR}%].
									When eaten:
