							[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.NegativeVoreEffect}:Does not work] while in the Steampunker's stomach.
							''' */
						/* Flavor:
							'''
							A peculiar little trinket fashioned together by the Steampunker, the great lass she is, for a measly sum.
