							Much to the Steampunker's frustration, though, it doesn't yet work across planes of reality, nor from excessively long distances. She's still working on that functionality.
							''' */
					}

					DemonCandy: {
						/* Short:
							'''
							Provides regeneration when digested
							'Isn't this just a jawbreaker covered in chocolate?'
							{$Mods.V2.ItemTooltip.Generic.HoldForInDepthFunctionAndLore}
							''' */
						/* Long:
							'''
							When eaten:
							- [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.PositiveEffect}:Grants the Regeneration buff] after running out of durability; this lingers for [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.DoSomething}:{Regen} minutes].
							If dropped onto the ground in the Underworld, it might bait out certain types of monsters.
							''' */
						/* Flavor:
